<title>USA: First Financial declares stock dividend.</title>
<headline>First Financial declares stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>STEVENS POINT, Wis. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Financial Corp of Wisconsin said Wednesday its board of directors declared a 25 percent common stock dividend, payable on December 30 to shareholders of record on December 16.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will be paid in cash at a rate to be determined by the closing bid price of the company's stock on the record date.</p>
<p>The company said it had 29.68 million common shares outstanding as of November 19.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
